# Stow ignore list for the `homedir` package.
#
# NOTE: providing this file REPLACES stow's built-in default ignore list
# entirely (see Stow.pm: a local ignore file short-circuits the defaults).
# So the block below reproduces stow 2.4.1's built-in defaults verbatim,
# followed by our own additions.

# --- stow built-in defaults (keep in sync with `stow`'s __DATA__ list) ---
RCS
.+,v

CVS
\.\#.+       # CVS conflict files / emacs lock files
\.cvsignore

\.svn
_darcs
\.hg

\.git
\.gitignore
\.gitmodules

.+~          # emacs backup files
\#.*\#       # emacs autosave files

^/README.*
^/LICENSE.*
^/COPYING

# --- our additions ---
# These are committed as ABSOLUTE symlinks pointing outside the repo.
# GNU Stow 2.4.x refuses to stow absolute symlinks ("they can't be
# unstowed") and aborts the whole run, so we skip them here. If you want
# any of them deployed, create the link directly in $HOME to its real
# absolute target instead of routing it through this repo.
secrets\.lua
bookmarks
wee_slack\.py
weemoji\.json
screenshots
